# Stupid Audio family

This file is a family index, copied into every checkout. Identify the current project from the workspace folder name or `git remote`. Use siblings to look things up; do not treat their trees as this repo.

## Layout

Checkouts live at `~/src/<RepoName>`. Never write a Meat Bag home path, OneDrive path, or other absolute machine path into committed files.

GitHub: `https://github.com/iamtew/<name>`. Pages: `https://iamtew.github.io/<name>`. Verify the remote before publishing a link. Do not guess a missing remote.

