Roles only. No feature copy here.

## Cross-repo

Names, logos, features, download URLs, and GitHub/Pages links come from that project’s checkout or its GitHub remote. Do not invent features.

Open a sibling for any cross-plugin work (blurbs, logos, links, shared naming). Read `~/src/<name>` if present; otherwise the GitHub remote.

Do not edit another family repo unless the Meat Bag asked. Do not pull sibling source into this repo except as static assets the current project already hosts.
